 Frontiere Journey into the research world Go Work with us You are here: Home Education Towards your future career Education Towards your future career Where students meet companies and alumni Beyond the curriculum We help you to make a more conscious decision about your career path. The Politecnico di Milano, through its Career Service , offers a year-long program of training and career guidance activities. Organized in collaboration with leading companies, these initiatives provide students and recent graduates with the opportunity to deepen their understanding of the professional world and gain essential skills to kick-start their careers. Participation is free and exclusively reserved for university students and recent graduates. Calendar Our activities We have plenty of activities for you! Among the hundreds of activities offered, you will find seminars, round tables, mentoring experiences, bootcamps, simulations, and competitions. The topics covered include both technical aspects related to emerging sectors, professions and roles, companies’ projects, as well as the development of soft skills, such as personal branding in the job market, the use of GenAI tools in job searching, contract negotiation, and more. Polimi Community All the websites of the ecosystem Accommodation Frontiere State Examination Career Service Alumni Webeep Sport Pok IT EN Campuses Milano Leonardo Milano Bovisa Cremona Lecco Mantova Piacenza Xi'an Browse the website The Politecnico Education Research Sustainable development Campus & services Prospective students Students Alumni Faculty and Researchers Staff Companies Press Resources WeBeep Work with us Search for classrooms Search for professors Search for programmes Lecture timetable Exam sessions Disabilities and Neurodiversity Intranet Campuses maps Brand identity Social media Contact us Contacts Address book Request maintenance Politecnico di Milano, Piazza Leonardo da Vinci 32, 20133 Milano | P.IVA 04376620151 - C.F. 80057930150 Acce