URES, INFRASTRUCTURES AND CONSTRUCTION CASES Read more 02 → 03 December Workshop Innovator Group Assessment Read more 09 → 10 December Workshop Innovator Group Assessment Read more See all events Assessment Center Meet employers and human resources Learn more Internship Center The starting point for your internships experiences Learn more All news 27 August 26 Career Service Award: registrations opened! Are you looking for a way to make your CV truly stand out while also reflecting more consciously on your professional journey? Leggi 21 July 26 Become a Student Career Advisor! Leggi 15 July 26 Mentorship Programme Management Engineering The new edition of the Mentorship Programme for Management Engineering students is coming up! Leggi it en Location Assessment Center Leonardo Internship Center Leonardo Assessment Center Bovisa Contacts Contact us Web Policy Web Policy Browse the website About us Services for Employers Internships Job/internship offers Career Guidance Events Career Days Employment data Special Projects Entrepreneurial careers PhD careers Resources Degree Programmes Report an IT problem Podcast Nonprofit Inclusion Student Associations Sport Passion in Action International Mobility Psychological wellbeing © 2026 | Sede legale: Piazza Leonardo da Vinci, 32 - 20133 Milano | P.IVA 04376620151 C.F. 80057930150 Privacy Policy Transparent Administration Location Contacts Web Policy Browse the website Resources it en © 2026 | Sede legale: Piazza Leonardo da Vinci, 32 - 20133 Milano | P.IVA 04376620151 C.F. 80057930150 Privacy Policy Transparent Administration × Noi   e terze parti selezionate  utilizziamo cookie o tecnologie simili  per finalità tecniche e, con il tuo consenso, anche per le finalità di misurazione come specificato nella cookie policy . Puoi liberamente prestare, rifiutare o revocare il tuo consenso, in qualsiasi momento, accedendo al pannello delle preferenze.  Il rifiuto del consenso può rendere non disponibili le relative funzioni. Usa il p